  "about_me": "<p>I am <strong>Lorenzo da Cunha</strong>, a front-end developer specialized in <strong>e-commerce</strong> and <strong>performance</strong>, with a primary focus on <strong>React</strong> and <strong>Shopify (Liquid)</strong>.</p><p>I have contributed to <strong>more than 75 projects</strong>, including <strong>over 60 e-commerce stores</strong>, as well as <strong>web systems</strong> and <strong>landing pages</strong>. My work goes beyond visuals: I focus on <strong>technical structure</strong>, <strong>performance</strong>, and <strong>user experience</strong>, ensuring that every interface not only works, but performs.</p><p>I am skilled at transforming business requirements into clear, scalable, and well-structured solutions, from layout to production-ready code.</p><p>Even at <strong>19 years old</strong>, I have built hands-on experience in real-world projects, always prioritizing <strong>organization</strong>, <strong>speed</strong>, and <strong>impact</strong>.</p>",
